#: ../../configuration.rst:334
msgid "The school abbreviation and the display name of the school"
msgstr "Das Schulkürzel und der Anzeigename der Schule"

#: ../../configuration.rst:335
msgid "See :ref:`configuration-locations`."
msgstr "Siehe :ref:`configuration-locations`."

#: ../../configuration.rst:340
msgid "Defaults"
msgstr "Voreinstellungen"

#: ../../configuration.rst:342
msgid ""
"The :envvar:`defaults` section can contain every optional key of an "
"account entry and a school entry, except :envvar:`location_id` and "
":envvar:`location_name`. A value in :envvar:`defaults` applies to every "
"account or school that doesn't set the key itself."
msgstr ""
"Der Abschnitt :envvar:`defaults` kann jeden optionalen Schlüssel eines "
"Konto- und eines Schuleintrags enthalten, außer :envvar:`location_id` und"
" :envvar:`location_name`. Ein Wert in :envvar:`defaults` gilt für jedes "
"Konto oder jede Schule, die den Schlüssel nicht selbst setzt."

#: ../../configuration.rst:348
msgid "Anonymize nobody, except the students of the account ``north``"
msgstr "Niemanden anonymisieren, außer den Schülern des Kontos ``north``"

#: ../../configuration.rst:366
msgid "Update from an earlier version"
msgstr "Update von einer früheren Version"

#: ../../configuration.rst:370
msgid ""
"Up to *Apple School Manager Connector* version 5.1.1, app settings and "
"UCR variables held the configuration."
msgstr ""
"Bis zur Version 5.1.1 von *Apple School Manager Connector* enthielten "
"App-Einstellungen und UCR-Variablen die Konfiguration."

#: ../../configuration.rst:373
msgid ""
"The update to version 6.0.0 moves their values to the settings file and "
"removes the UCR variables. You don't need to do anything. The password "
"stays in :file:`/etc/asm.secret`. The settings file refers to "
":file:`/etc/asm.secret`. The account gets the name ``default``."
msgstr ""
"Das Update auf Version 6.0.0 überträgt ihre Werte in die "
"Einstellungsdatei und entfernt die UCR-Variablen. Sie müssen nichts tun. "
"Das Passwort bleibt in :file:`/etc/asm.secret`, und die Einstellungsdatei"
" verweist darauf. Das Konto erhält den Namen ``default``."

#: ../../configuration.rst:380
msgid ""
":numref:`configuration-accounts-migration-mapping-table` maps the former "
"app settings and UCR variables to their corresponding keys in the "
"settings file."
msgstr ""
":numref:`configuration-accounts-migration-mapping-table` ordnet die "
"früheren App-Einstellungen und UCR-Variablen den entsprechenden "
"Schlüsseln in der Einstellungsdatei zu."

#: ../../configuration.rst:385
msgid "Former app settings and UCR variables"
msgstr "Bisherige App-Einstellungen und UCR-Variablen"

#: ../../configuration.rst:389
msgid "Former setting"
msgstr "Bisherige Einstellung"

#: ../../configuration.rst:390
msgid "Key in the settings file"
msgstr "Schlüssel in der Einstellungsdatei"

#: ../../configuration.rst:392
msgid "``asm/username``"
msgstr "``asm/username``"

